# Architecture

## Stack technique

| Couche | Technologie |
|--------|-------------|
| Backend framework | Spring Boot 3.3 + Java 21 |
| ORM / DB | Hibernate 6.5 + PostgreSQL 16 |
| Authentification | JWT (access + refresh) + Argon2id |
| Cache / Sessions | Redis |
| Docs API | SpringDoc OpenAPI 3 |
| Frontend framework | React 19 + TypeScript 5 |
| Build tool frontend | Vite 6 |
| Styles | TailwindCSS 4 |
| State management | React Context + useReducer |
| Testing backend | JUnit 5 + Mockito + Testcontainers |
| Testing frontend | Vitest + React Testing Library |
| CI/CD | GitHub Actions |
